---
layout: page/layout
---

<section id="miscellanies" style="--box-bg-color: <%= page.blockBgColor %>;" class="fade-in-once">
  <section id="banner" class="box">
    <div class="left">
      <h1>Miscellanies</h1>
      <h2>短篇│塗鴉</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="right flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="hover-box flex flex-col items-center gap-8 text-center w-fit px-4 xl:px-0" data-mobile-toggle="hover-box">
        <%- partial('_partial/svg/branch_top') %>
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="context default flex items-center justify-center">
            <h6>
              「一個人能使自己成為自己，比什麼都重要。」<br>
              　　　——維吉尼亞·吳爾芙《自己的房間》
            </h6>
          </div>
          <div class="context hover flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
            <h6 class="text-center">
              此區存放隨筆、短詩<br>
              不屬於任何世界觀的短文、塗鴉<br>
              ​未完成的草稿，或沒參成的企劃<br>
            </h6>
          </div>
        </div>
        <%- partial('_partial/svg/branch_bottom') %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="creates-area" class=" mt-10">
    <div class="p-8 box relative">
      <h2 class="box-title">
        ILLUSTRATION
      </h2>
      <div class="flex flex-row justify-center">
        <div id="gallery">
          <div class="gallery-sizer"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="p-8 box relative">
      <h2 class="box-title">
        STORY
      </h2>
      <%- partial('_partial/post-category-pager', {
    id: 'story',
    category: ['others', 'poem'],
    perPage: 5,
    listClass: 'px-6',
    prevText: '上一頁',
    nextText: '下一頁'
  }) %>
    </div>
  </section>
</section>


<%- partial('_partial/cloudinary-gallery', {
  tag: 'others',
  captions: {
  }
}) %>